WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:08.150
You can’t defeat me because 
you're fake and I'm real!

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:11.130
I’ll show you hell!

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:17.930
What’s going on?

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:23.250
If Bohman wins this duel, will 
Bohman and Playmaker switch places?

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:25.520
This is getting exciting.

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:28.110
Playmaker's a fake?

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:30.940
An AI copy of Bohman?

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:32.780
That's...

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:35.250
…actually possible!

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:37.530
He has the traits!

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:39.730
He’s great at dueling, like an AI!

00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:42.100
Hey, Playmaker.

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:46.530
What's up?  Is what he saying true?

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:51.660
I can only say that whoever 
wins this duel is the real one.

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:53.610
He didn’t deny it?

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:58.040
So Playmaker is the fake?

00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:20.380
Our lives aren't forever

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:27.190
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:34.470
Even if it's not the right direction, 
just keep looking forward

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:41.040
Sharing hope for the future

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:47.910
tell me  We're searching for 
memories lost in the darkness

00:01:47.910 --> 00:01:55.030
I feel your flame  Your 
impulses pierce the light

00:01:55.030 --> 00:02:01.730
I want to share your pain

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:32.760
I’ll continue the duel!  Here I go!

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:35.940
My turn!  I draw!

00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:39.050
I summon Widget Kid from my hand!

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:45.980
I can now Special Summon a Cyberse 
from my hand in defense position.

00:02:45.980 --> 00:02:48.990
Appear, RAM Clouder!

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:51.980
RAM Clouder’s effect activates!

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:58.560
By tributing a monster, I can Special 
Summon a Cyberse from my graveyard.

00:02:58.560 --> 00:03:04.930
I tribute Widget Kid to 
Special Summon Update Jammer!

00:03:04.930 --> 00:03:07.770
He wants to seal Link Spells again?

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:09.260
That’s pointless.

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:11.310
Due to Twin Hydradrive Knight’s effect...

00:03:11.310 --> 00:03:15.780
...since Update Jammer is Wind 
Attribute, its effects are negated!

00:03:17.310 --> 00:03:22.190
It negates the effects of 
Fire and Wind monsters!

00:03:22.190 --> 00:03:25.020
Whose side should I take?

00:03:25.020 --> 00:03:27.680
That side?  This side?

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:31.640
But they both have bad personalities.

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:35.890
And even if he wins, my 
safety's not guaranteed.

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:38.930
I made my choice!

00:03:38.930 --> 00:03:42.600
As everyone expects, I choose Playmaker!

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:46.150
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:03:46.150 --> 00:03:50.620
The summoning conditions 
are at least two Cyberses!

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:52.280
Link Summon!

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:56.460
Appear, Link 3 Detonate Deleter!

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:59.450
I activate Update Jammer’s 
effect from my graveyard!

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:04.630
The Link Monster summoned using 
this monster can attack twice!

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:06.600
Attack twice?

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:13.060
This effect activates from the graveyard, 
so your monster can't affect it!

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:18.010
Battle!  Detonate Deleter 
attacks Hydradrive Knight!

00:04:18.010 --> 00:04:23.470
As long as I have Judgment Arrows, Twin 
Hydradrive Knight’s ATK are doubled.

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:25.290
It strikes you back!

00:04:25.290 --> 00:04:27.640
Detonate Deleter’s effect!

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:32.320
The monster it battles is destroyed 
without calculating damage!

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:33.250
What?

00:04:33.610 --> 00:04:39.130
I see!  If there’s no damage, Judgment 
Arrows’s effect doesn’t matter!

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:48.180
Good!  Now Bohman has no 
monsters to defend with!

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:51.240
If this next attack gets through, we win!

00:04:51.240 --> 00:04:52.970
This will end you!

00:04:52.970 --> 00:04:55.710
Detonate Deleter attacks you directly!

00:04:56.090 --> 00:04:58.820
He’s actually going to lose?

00:04:58.820 --> 00:04:59.980
I won’t let you!

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:02.150
The Quick-Play Spell, Half Shut!

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:08.120
A faceup monster's ATK are halved 
until the end of the turn!

00:05:15.970 --> 00:05:18.140
He had a defense card ready.

00:05:18.140 --> 00:05:20.400
I end my turn.

00:05:24.350 --> 00:05:26.570
Brother!  Pull yourself together!

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:29.940
I won’t lose.

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:33.550
I must remember those hellish days!

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:43.870
Ten years ago, I saw you rescued.

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:50.000
Wait!  He’s a fake!

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:52.030
The real one's here!

00:05:56.720 --> 00:06:00.860
Afterwards, I continued to live in despair.

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:05.980
All alone in eternal darkness.  Forever...

00:06:05.980 --> 00:06:07.980
Forever!

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:14.450
I will never forgive you!

00:06:21.630 --> 00:06:22.870
What?

00:06:34.020 --> 00:06:36.400
I’m the emissary of revenge.

00:06:36.400 --> 00:06:39.710
I won’t fall until I defeat you!

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:43.690
My turn!  I draw!

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:47.150
This is a shocking turn of events.

00:06:47.150 --> 00:06:51.620
I Special Summon Hydradrive 
Booster from my hand.

00:06:51.620 --> 00:06:56.360
I can Special Summon it when we both have 
no monsters in our Main Monster Zones.

00:06:56.690 --> 00:07:02.330
When a Hydradrive is Special Summoned, Break 
Hydradrive’s effect activates from my graveyard.

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:06.300
I can Special Summon it in defense position.

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:10.980
The Continuous Trap, 
Hydradrive Cycle activates!

00:07:10.980 --> 00:07:16.150
I pay 400 LP to Special Summon a 
Hydradrive Token in defense position!

00:07:16.150 --> 00:07:19.620
He willingly gave up LP 
to get monsters, so...

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:23.010
It’s coming.  He hasn’t given up.

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:24.100
Right.

00:07:24.100 --> 00:07:26.980
The requirement has now been met!

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:28.290
Requirement?

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:31.270
Come, Data Storm!

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:42.420
What?  What’s happening?

00:07:42.420 --> 00:07:44.780
What are you planning to do, Brother?

00:07:45.280 --> 00:07:48.750
Witness my power, Playmaker!

00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:53.490
This wind…  He has 650 LP…  Can it be?

00:07:55.730 --> 00:08:02.200
When I have 1000 or lower LP, I can get a 
random Link Monster from the Data Storm!

00:08:03.130 --> 00:08:04.430
That’s…

00:08:04.430 --> 00:08:08.080
I activate my Skill, Storm Access!

00:08:11.440 --> 00:08:13.960
The wind suddenly got stronger.

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:15.670
Is something happening?

00:08:15.670 --> 00:08:18.380
Can it be that Playmaker's dueling?

00:08:18.380 --> 00:08:19.840
Let’s hurry!

00:08:31.950 --> 00:08:33.230
Wow!

00:08:35.550 --> 00:08:39.710
It's possible to use a 
Skill during a Master Duel?

00:08:39.710 --> 00:08:45.460
I can't create a Data Storm 
this powerful from nothing!

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:48.450
So how could he?

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:51.910
Appear, my three circuits!

00:08:55.850 --> 00:08:57.300
Link Summon!

00:08:57.300 --> 00:09:02.520
Appear, Link 1 Burn, Flow 
and Coolant Hydradrives!

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:05.490
Three Hydradrives with different Attributes!

00:09:05.490 --> 00:09:07.930
Prepare yourself, Playmaker!

00:09:07.930 --> 00:09:11.630
Appear!  The circuit that connects the truth!

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:17.160
The summoning conditions are 
three Hydradrive Link Monsters!

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:19.020
Link Summon!

00:09:19.020 --> 00:09:22.070
Appear, the emissary of revenge!

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:28.110
Link 3 Trident Hydradrive Lord!

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:32.080
That’s the Link Monster he 
acquired via Storm Access.

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:36.650
When Trident Hydradrive 
Lord is Link Summoned...

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:40.800
...it can gain the Attributes of 
the monsters used to summon it!

00:09:45.380 --> 00:09:50.000
Now Hydradrive Lord is Fire, 
Water and Wind Attribute!

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:53.000
As long as Hydradrive Lord is on the field...

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:56.520
...your monsters with those Attributes 
have their effects negated!

00:09:56.520 --> 00:09:59.520
But Detonate Deleter is Dark Attribute.

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:01.450
It's not affected!

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:03.020
Too bad!

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:10.490
I equip the Equip Spell, Hydradrive 
Accelerator from my hand on Hydradrive Lord!

00:10:10.490 --> 00:10:15.130
When the monster equipped with 
Hydradrive Accelerator is Wind...

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:21.430
...effects that target my cards, other 
than the equipped monster, can be negated.

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:25.800
And if it’s Water, trap 
cards can't affect it.

00:10:25.800 --> 00:10:30.270
And if it’s Fire, your 
spell cards can't affect it!

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:36.760
That monster’s defense is too strong!

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:42.460
Battle!  Hydradrive Lord 
attacks Detonate Deleter!

00:10:42.460 --> 00:10:45.700
Judgment Arrows’s effect!

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:50.330
Hydradrive Lord’s ATK are doubled!

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:52.940
4600 ATK?

00:10:52.940 --> 00:10:56.080
This is bad, Playmaker!  We can’t take it!

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:59.580
It’s the end!  Vanish, Playmaker!

00:11:12.490 --> 00:11:15.350
My brother won!

00:11:16.350 --> 00:11:20.840
Now give me back my body, Playmaker!

00:11:24.510 --> 00:11:25.770
Not yet.

00:11:27.010 --> 00:11:28.610
Playmaker?

00:11:28.610 --> 00:11:31.700
How can you still stand?

00:11:31.700 --> 00:11:34.770
The moment I took the attack…

00:11:36.640 --> 00:11:39.450
I activate the trap, Link Ration!

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:55.560
When our battling Link Monsters have a total 
of five Link Markers or more, I regain 1000 LP.

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:57.540
How insolent!

00:11:57.540 --> 00:12:06.360
And when my Link Monster is destroyed, Link Ration 
Special Summons a Ration Token in defense position.

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:12.020
He’s down to 100 LP, but he 
still has his fighting spirit.

00:12:12.020 --> 00:12:14.780
No wonder you’re my copy.

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:17.790
Did I choose the wrong ally?

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:19.760
It’s not too late to join his side…

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:22.130
But you're fighting in vain.

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:25.000
I’ll bury you along with that Ignis!

00:12:25.770 --> 00:12:27.780
I'm too late!

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:29.730
Do your best, Playmaker!

00:12:30.210 --> 00:12:32.100
I want to ask one thing.

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:35.210
Who kidnapped you in the Lost Incident?

00:12:36.180 --> 00:12:38.210
That's what you're asking?

00:12:38.210 --> 00:12:42.180
Dr. Kogami, of course!

00:12:43.580 --> 00:12:46.920
After hearing that, I’m convinced.

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:49.920
You're not my copy!

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:53.310
Of course.  You’re the copy!

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:57.880
Wrong.  The memories you have…

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:02.640
I have no memories of my body and 
consciousness being replaced!

00:13:02.640 --> 00:13:06.100
You must be imprinted with fake memories!

00:13:06.100 --> 00:13:08.490
That's nonsense!

00:13:08.490 --> 00:13:10.970
I have clear memories.

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:14.350
You’re the one imprinted 
with fake memories!

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:18.200
Which one’s right?

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:20.690
There’s no way to check memories.

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:24.200
Exactly.  There’s no way to check.

00:13:25.470 --> 00:13:32.930
If someone can imprint fake memories, 
there’s a chance my memories were replaced too.

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:37.660
No one can prove which of us is real!

00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:42.650
But I still believe I’m the real one!

00:13:50.050 --> 00:13:52.020
Ouch…

00:13:52.760 --> 00:13:54.410
Sorry.

00:13:54.410 --> 00:13:56.760
Do you play Duel Monsters too?

00:13:56.760 --> 00:13:58.990
Yeah.  You too?

00:13:58.990 --> 00:14:01.460
Yeah.  I love it too!

00:14:01.460 --> 00:14:05.210
Want to come to my house and look at my deck?

00:14:05.520 --> 00:14:09.660
That person was Revolver.

00:14:10.130 --> 00:14:16.140
That's why he couldn’t stand his 
wrongdoings and became my voice of hope.

00:14:16.690 --> 00:14:20.740
Hey you.  Remember three things.

00:14:20.740 --> 00:14:23.980
That’s the truth inside me!

00:14:23.980 --> 00:14:27.660
One!  I promise to win this duel!

00:14:28.890 --> 00:14:34.450
Two!  I'll retrieve Kusanagi’s 
brother’s consciousness data from you!

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:40.100
Three!  I'll uncover your identity 
and the one controlling you!

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:42.330
Playmaker…

00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:45.950
How dare a copy speak nonsense!

00:14:45.950 --> 00:14:48.810
I’ll make sure you can’t talk again!

00:14:48.810 --> 00:14:50.580
That won’t happen!

00:14:50.580 --> 00:14:52.770
Because I'll defeat you this turn!

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:55.520
My turn!  I draw!

00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:58.930
I summon Cyberse Gadget from my hand!

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:04.350
And I Special Summon Catche 
Eve L2 from my graveyard!

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:09.620
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:12.920
The summoning condition 
is one Normal Monster!

00:15:14.690 --> 00:15:16.200
Link Summon!

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:18.880
Link 1 Link Spider!

00:15:20.840 --> 00:15:22.810
Link Spider’s effect!

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:27.010
I Special Summon a Normal Monster 
from my hand next to its link!

00:15:27.010 --> 00:15:30.150
I Special Summon Protron!

00:15:33.510 --> 00:15:35.150
I Link Summon again!

00:15:35.150 --> 00:15:38.720
The summoning conditions are two Cyberses!

00:15:40.180 --> 00:15:43.230
Link 2 Flame Administrator!

00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:48.160
Flame Administrator’s effect-

00:15:48.160 --> 00:15:51.410
I won’t let you!  
Hydradrive Lord’s effect!

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:54.870
It negates Fire monsters' effects!

00:15:55.420 --> 00:15:59.080
Since Cyberse Gadget was used to 
Link Summon, here's its effect!

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:05.170
When it’s sent from the field to the 
graveyard, I Special Summon a Gadget Token!

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:08.380
A third Link Summon!

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:13.330
The summoning condition is 
a Level 4 or lower Cyberse!

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:19.060
Appear, Link 1 Link Disciple!

00:16:19.060 --> 00:16:21.260
The circuit that leads to the future!

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:27.680
I set Catche Eve L2 and Flame 
Administrator in the Link Markers!

00:16:27.680 --> 00:16:32.540
Appear, Link 2 Clock Spartoi!

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:37.130
Instead of a Link 3, he 
summoned a new Link 2 monster?

00:16:37.130 --> 00:16:39.080
What are you planning?

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:41.880
Clock Spartoi’s effect activates!

00:16:41.880 --> 00:16:47.220
When it’s Link Summoned, I add 
Cynet Fusion in my deck to my hand.

00:16:47.220 --> 00:16:48.120
What?

00:16:48.120 --> 00:16:51.590
That’s a fusion card!  Can it be?

00:16:51.590 --> 00:16:55.600
I activate Linkuriboh's 
effect from my graveyard!

00:16:56.120 --> 00:17:01.570
By tributing a Level 1 monster, 
it Special Summons itself!

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:04.050
Clock Spartoi’s effect activates!

00:17:04.570 --> 00:17:07.770
When a monster is Special 
Summoned next to its link...

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:11.250
...I negate a Level 4 or lower monster's effects and Special Summon it

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:13.240
from the graveyard next to its link!

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:16.240
Appear, Clock Wyvern!

00:17:16.910 --> 00:17:20.050
When did that monster go to the graveyard?

00:17:20.050 --> 00:17:22.180
Was it back then?

00:17:22.710 --> 00:17:26.440
He sent it to the graveyard on the 2nd turn!

00:17:27.420 --> 00:17:32.870
Playmaker!  You expected 
all this from the start?

00:17:32.870 --> 00:17:37.790
A fake like you can't anticipate my plans!

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:41.870
I activate the spell card, Cynet Fusion!

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:47.750
I fuse Clock Wyvern, Link 
Disciple and Clock Spartoi!

00:17:48.100 --> 00:17:52.440
The strong ones gather 
before its grand wings!

00:17:52.440 --> 00:17:54.420
Become a new legend!

00:17:54.910 --> 00:17:56.520
Fusion Summon!

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:06.980
Come out!  Cyberse Clock Dragon!

00:18:19.480 --> 00:18:22.880
It’s a Dark Attribute Fusion Monster!

00:18:22.880 --> 00:18:25.330
Cyberse Clock Dragon’s effect!

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:30.000
For every Link Material's Link Marker,
 I send a card from the top of my deck

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:33.160
to the graveyard to give it 1000 ATK!

00:18:33.950 --> 00:18:37.830
I send three cards from 
my deck to the graveyard.

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:41.830
Cyberse Clock Dragon gains 3000 ATK!

00:18:45.120 --> 00:18:47.310
5500 ATK!

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:48.760
This is bad!

00:18:48.760 --> 00:18:50.930
He can’t survive this attack!

00:18:50.930 --> 00:18:54.480
Destroy him and Hydradrive Lord, Playmaker!

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:55.680
I won’t let you!

00:18:56.240 --> 00:19:00.200
I activate the Continuous Trap, 
Hydradrive Cycle's effect!

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:08.170
I pay 400 LP to Special Summon a Fire 
Hydradrive Token on your field in defense position!

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:12.390
Why our field?

00:19:12.390 --> 00:19:14.660
Hydradrive Lord’s effect!

00:19:14.660 --> 00:19:21.470
Until the end of the turn, all your monsters 
become the same Attribute as the target monster!

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:24.440
I select Hydradrive Token!

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:25.920
I see.

00:19:25.920 --> 00:19:29.680
If he uses that Token to change 
Clock Dragon to Fire Attribute…

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:35.240
No!  Due to Hydradrive Lord’s effect, 
Fire monsters' effects are negated!

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:38.670
Clock Dragon’s ATK return to 2500!

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:43.390
I told you that I know 
everything about your dueling.

00:19:43.390 --> 00:19:45.230
Are you sure?

00:19:46.310 --> 00:19:49.530
Clock Dragon’s additional effect!

00:19:49.530 --> 00:19:53.770
When this card and a Link Monster 
are in my Monster Zone...

00:19:53.770 --> 00:19:59.510
...you can only attack and 
use effects on Clock Dragon!

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:02.560
What?  You have a Link Monster?

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:06.360
You did!  Linkuriboh!

00:20:06.360 --> 00:20:11.480
Hydradrive Lord can only select 
Clock Dragon’s Dark Attribute!

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:14.090
You can't negate my effect!

00:20:15.590 --> 00:20:16.560
Battle!

00:20:16.560 --> 00:20:19.570
Attack Trident Hydradrive Lord!

00:20:20.160 --> 00:20:22.540
Judgment Arrows’s effect!

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:26.510
Hydradrive Lord’s ATK are doubled!

00:20:26.510 --> 00:20:27.770
That’s pointless!

00:20:27.770 --> 00:20:29.970
Go!  Pulse Pressure!

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:47.460
You did it!  Playmaker wins!

00:20:47.460 --> 00:20:51.240
I knew you'd win from the start, Playmaker!

00:20:52.550 --> 00:20:55.710
I lost?

00:20:55.710 --> 00:20:58.710
So you lost, Bohman.

00:20:58.710 --> 00:21:00.370
But that’s fine.

00:21:00.370 --> 00:21:05.180
You now learned of Playmaker’s 
indomitable fighting spirit.

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:17.780
Playmaker!  My brother will come back!

00:21:17.780 --> 00:21:20.090
Stay tuned!

00:21:25.750 --> 00:21:28.140
Are you okay, Playmaker?

00:21:28.710 --> 00:21:29.880
Soulburner!

00:21:30.240 --> 00:21:33.350
The whole Wind World is destabilizing!

00:21:37.110 --> 00:21:39.440
The world is vanishing!

00:21:39.440 --> 00:21:41.940
If we stay here, we'll be in trouble!

00:21:41.940 --> 00:21:44.790
Let’s use the escape program to log out!

00:21:44.790 --> 00:21:47.780
Playmaker, we should go too!

00:21:47.780 --> 00:21:53.360
Bohman…  And who is the 
one who controls him?

00:21:53.360 --> 00:21:56.520
I swear I'll find out who!

00:22:19.570 --> 00:22:26.030
Memories that don't disappear
And memories that disappeared

00:22:26.030 --> 00:22:32.610
I quietly "NOW LOADING..." those scenes

00:22:33.040 --> 00:22:36.110
Memories left behind  Erased memories

00:22:36.110 --> 00:22:39.250
What was the PASSWORD again?

00:22:39.680 --> 00:22:44.000
ACCESS records  Restored memories

00:22:44.000 --> 00:22:46.820
Challenge "the you inside you"

00:22:51.530 --> 00:22:57.690
You're a Network  The 
World that spreads beyond

00:22:57.690 --> 00:23:00.840
With repeating "nows"

00:23:01.170 --> 00:23:04.760
What about you?  "Live for now"

00:23:04.760 --> 00:23:10.740
Grab the Shooting Star in 
the sky with both your hands

00:23:10.740 --> 00:23:14.020
Overcome "now" with all your might  Yell!

00:23:36.120 --> 00:23:40.440
After a long silence, they're back.

00:23:40.440 --> 00:23:44.810
Their sense of duty is strong as ever.

00:23:44.810 --> 00:23:48.100
They're the Knights of Hanoi!

00:23:48.100 --> 00:23:54.540
To kill the Ignis - the threat against 
humanity - they return front and center.

00:23:54.540 --> 00:23:57.920
Revolver is finally making his move!

00:23:57.920 --> 00:24:02.180
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Hanoi Returns

00:24:02.180 --> 00:24:04.600
Into the VRAINS!
